import json,hashlib
from pathlib import Path
import pandas as pd
from sklearn.metrics import adjusted_rand_score
B=Path(__file__).resolve().parent
rows=[];change=[]
for tier in ['legacy','mixed']:
 d=B/('corner_fit_'+tier);cv=pd.read_csv(d/'inner_cv_summary.csv');ari=pd.read_csv(d/'inner_fit_label_sensitivity_summary.csv');x=cv.merge(ari,on='method_id');x.insert(0,'tier',tier);rows.append(x)
a=pd.read_csv(B/'corner_fit_legacy/worker_labels.csv');b=pd.read_csv(B/'corner_fit_mixed/worker_labels.csv')
for mid,g in a[a.known].groupby('method_id'):
 other=mid.replace('__legacy','__mixed');h=b[b.method_id.eq(other)&b.known];m=g.merge(h,on='worker_id');change.append({'legacy_method':mid,'mixed_method':other,'common_people':len(m),'full_history_extension_ARI':adjusted_rand_score(m.class_id_x,m.class_id_y)})
pd.concat(rows).to_csv(B/'M1_EXPERIMENT_SUMMARY.csv',index=False);pd.DataFrame(change).to_csv(B/'M1_LEGACY_MIXED_LABEL_CHANGE.csv',index=False)
lines=['# Bounded corner-distance personnel experiments','', '## Finding','', 'A stable universal partition is not supported. Original Rnew2 is independently reproduced and is a useful conditional two-class reference. The new legacy/mixed single-person corner-risk candidates provide modest history/discovery separation, but their fine memberships are less stable. The frozen discovery-nominated legacy meanK3 fails to improve the reused-assessment m2 shared-library outcomes. This negative transfer remains part of the record; the direct m2 extension is separately registered and trained only on history.','', '## Finite m1 family and inner-fold results','', '|Tier|Method|Within distance|Between−within|9° gap|Drop-two ARI|','|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
for x in pd.concat(rows).itertuples():lines.append(f'|{x.tier}|{x.method_id}|{x.within_distance:.6f}|{x.distance_gap:.6f}|{x.distance9_gap:.6f}|{x.ARI_mean:.3f}|')
lines+=['','Distance here is the registered representation .5(BEVmean+topmean)/pairscale, not an extra scientific score. Mean building results are internal selection diagnostics. Original Rnew2 ARI .955 uses leave-one-building, whereas these new model sensitivities drop two buildings; do not treat them as identical resampling tests. Random draw quantiles are permutation variation, not uncertainty intervals.','', '## Frozen primary legacy meanK3 membership','']
man=json.load(open(B/'corner_fit_legacy/METHOD_MANIFEST.json'));mid='C_corner_mean_K3__new__legacy'
for c,ws in man[mid]['classes'].items():lines.append('- '+c+': '+', '.join(ws))
lines+=['','All 35 new-source workers receive a label; 25 other-source workers remain outside domain. These are conditional geometric roles, not universal skill or trustworthiness categories. Descriptive Q means are approximately −5.725, −3.967, +6.798 in C01/C02/C03; Q correlation is material. Full class profiles and other frozen memberships/unknown reasons are in each fit directory.','', '## Mixed-history comparison with original Rnew2', '', 'All six mixed m1 candidates have smaller matched held-out between-minus-within gaps than fold-refitted Rnew2 (about −.00046 to−.00100). K4 modestly lowers within distance, but does not jointly improve separation; this is a trade-off rather than a superior fine hierarchy.', '', '## Block probes and support','', 'The frozen reused-assessment probe contains 2,552 own-rule ABCs over 200 nested paths and a separate category-independent library with 152 anchors/63,476 disjoint pairs. Own-rule paths retain fixed A/B/C exchanged blocks and nested common core for every feasible integer n5–17. Cross-method comparisons use the shared endpoint library, not differently sampled own-rule curves. Exact metrics and support are in audit_corner/fresh_blocks outputs.','', 'The new direct m2 training panel is label-independent and history-only: 20 images, ten buildings,160anchors,n5/9/13/17,two core paths,7,670native teams,144,140 disjoint pairs. It is the sole registered block-level extension, using two K models and bounded fixed-start optimization. Registration and native request hashes precede fitting. All structural failures and missing distances remain explicit.','', '## Audit and reproduction','', 'CLASS_LEARNING_AUDIT.md records full code-audit conclusions, scope/Semi limitations, candidate multiplicity and raw reconstruction closure. REPRODUCE_LEARNING.md and reproduce_learning.py provide explicit-root reconstruction. Independently audited design and arithmetic receipts are under audit_statistics and audit_replay.']
(B/'CORNER_LEARNING_EXPERIMENTS.md').write_text('\n'.join(lines)+'\n')
